// R-266, S-678: a `use` that takes a name that is a keyword is E0002 and a failed name, so it is no
// dependency (E0310, §15.1). `match.onsa` takes `a` and `a` takes `match` (here), and `kw/match.onsa` takes `b`
// while `b` takes `match` by a list: no cycle. The only diagnostics are the two E0002.
use match                                           //~ E0002

